        "citation": "Situation Report 1 \u2014 Flood 2025 (Bangladesh Red Crescent Society, 2 June 2025), reporting the situation as of 1 June 2025: Sylhet, Sunamganj, Moulvibazar, Habiganj, Netrokona, Noakhali, Bhola, Khagrachari, Bandarban and Rangamati severely affected.",
